sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): N/a

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = Authorized, idToken.idToken = <Configured invalid_idtoken_idtoken>, idToken.type = <Configured invalid_idtoken_type>, eventType = Started)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: idTokenInfo.status must be Invalid or Unknown

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Ended, triggerReason = Deauthorized, transactionInfo.stoppedReason = DeAuthorized)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
